    edgeCases: ['Dependence adds covariance terms, so information is not additive.', 'If the support depends on θ the classical Fisher information may be undefined.', 'I.i.d. scaling by n underlies the √n rate in the Cramér–Rao bound and asymptotic normality of the MLE.', 'Zero information at a parameter value gives no local identification there.'],
    applications: ['Cramér–Rao bounds for samples', 'Optimal experimental design', 'Asymptotic normality of the MLE', 'Information geometry of statistical models'],
    references: ['Casella & Berger, Statistical Inference', 'Rao, Linear Statistical Inference and Its Applications', 'Kay, Fundamentals of Statistical Signal Processing: Estimation Theory'],
